    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University's Paediatrics Department recently participated in a significant WHO workshop held in Istanbul, Turkey. The workshop focused on data analysis and manuscript writing for a research project studying the optimal hospitalization duration for young infants with signs of serious bacterial infection (PSBI). This global research project involves multi-country clinical trials aimed at improving the management of young infants at risk of PSBI, a condition with significant mortality risk.",
